    {
      "framed" : true,
      "id" : "7FF3BA5C-4F5E-492E-B4A5-BE925405E652",
      "size" : 12,
      "text" : "Logic Functional Unit\n/LFU low (pulled up = off) drives D0-D7 from the 253 muxes:\nOP1 OP0 = 00 A AND B, 01 A OR B, 10 A XOR B, 11 0x00.\nGT = A > B, EQ = A = B (unsigned, 74HC682), always driven.",
      "x" : 700,
      "y" : 1300
    }
  ],
